<title>NEW ZEALAND: CRICKET-NZ TAKE UPPER HAND VS SRI LANKA IN TEST.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NZ TAKE UPPER HAND VS SRI LANKA IN TEST.</headline>
<dateline>HAMILTON, New Zealand 1997-03-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand, having dismissed Sri Lanka for 170 and amassed a first innings total of 222, were 53 for one wicket at the close of play on the second day of the second test on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>New Zealand first innings 222 (B. Pocock 85, M. Muralitharan 3-43, N. Zoysa 3-47).</p>
<p>Second innings 53 for one (B.Young 22)</p>
<p>Sri Lanka (R.Mahanama 45, H. Davis 5-63, D. Vettori 4-46).</p>
